UnitalGroebner.Divides.mk","kind":"ctor","line":53,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/unital-groebner-bases/unital-groebner-bases-chapter/leading-terms.lean#L53-L53","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.UnitalGroebner.Divides","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.UnitalGroebner.Divides","kind":"structure","line":50,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/unital-groebner-bases/unital-groebner-bases-chapter/leading-terms.lean#L50-L61","doc":"Divisibility: β divides f if there exist u, v ∈ B and scalar ∈ R*\nsuch that scalar · LT(u · β · v) = LT(f). ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.UnitalGroebner.LeadingTerm.leadingCoeff_ne_zero","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.UnitalGroebner.LeadingTerm.leadingCoeff_ne_zero","kind":"theorem","line":48,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/unital-groebner-bases/unital-groebner-bases-chapter/leading-terms.lean#L48-L48","doc":"The leading coefficient is nonzero. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.UnitalGroebner.LeadingTerm.leadingCoeff","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.UnitalGroebner.LeadingTerm.leadingCoeff","kind":"def","line":46,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/unital-groebner-bases/unital-groebner-bases-chapter/leading-terms.lean#L46-L46","doc":"The leading coefficient LC(f): coefficient of LM(f). ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.UnitalGroebner.LeadingTerm.leadingMono","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.UnitalGroebner.LeadingTerm.leadingMono","kind":"def","line":44,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/unital-groebner-bases/unital-groebner-bases-chapter/leading-terms.lean#L44-L44","doc":"The leading monomial LM(f): largest basis element. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.UnitalGroebner.LeadingTerm.mk","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.UnitalGroebner.LeadingTerm.mk","kind":"ctor","line":42,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/unital-groebner-bases/unital-groebner-bases-chapter/leading-terms.lean#L42-L42","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.UnitalGroebner.LeadingTerm","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.UnitalGroebner.LeadingTerm","kind":"structure","line":34,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/unital-groebner-bases/unital-groebner-bases-chapter/leading-terms.lean#L34-L48","doc":"Leading term data for a nonzero element f ∈ A written in the\nmonomial basis B with respect to a well-ordering <.\n\nGiven f = c₁b₁ + c₂b₂ + ⋯ + cₙbₙ with b₁ > b₂ > ⋯ > bₙ:\n- LM(f) = b₁  (leading monomial)\n- LC(f) = c₁  (leading coefficient)\n- LT(f) = c₁ · b₁ (leading term) ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.UnitalGroebner.Term.coeff_ne_zero","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.UnitalGroebner.Term.coeff_ne_zero","kind":"theorem","line":32,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/unital-groebner-bases/unital-groebner-bases-chapter/leading-terms.lean#L32-L32","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.UnitalGroebner.Term.mono","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.UnitalGroebner.Term.mono","kind":"def","line":31,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/unital-groebner-bases/unital-groebner-bases-chapter/leading-terms.lean#L31-L31","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.UnitalGroebner.Term.coeff","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.UnitalGroebner.Term.coeff","kind":"def","line":30,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/unital-groebner-bases/unital-groebner-bases-chapter/leading-terms.lean#L30-L30","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.UnitalGroebner.Term.mk","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.UnitalGroebner.Term.mk","kind":"ctor","line":29,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/unital-groebner-bases/unital-groebner-bases-chapter/leading-terms.lean#L29-L29","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.UnitalGroebner.Term","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.UnitalGroebner.Term","kind":"structure","line":27,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/unital-groebner-bases/unital-groebner-bases-chapter/leading-terms.lean#L27-L32","doc":"A monomial basis element together with its coefficient.\nRepresents a term c · b where c ∈ R* and b ∈ B. ","signatureChunk":0}]}